      hu: ["Alapítás éve: 1938", "Legmagasabb pont: Liakura (2457 m)", "Gazdag endemikus hegyi növényekben", "Görögország második legrégebbi nemzeti parkja"],
      ro: ["Înființat în: 1938", "Cel mai înalt vârf: Liakoura (2457 m)", "Bogat în plante montane endemice", "Al doilea cel mai vechi parc național din Grecia"],
      en: ["Established in 1938", "Highest peak: Liakoura (2,457 m)", "Rich in endemic mountain plant species", "Greece's second oldest national park"],
